# Design system

Read @docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md. Restyle shadcn. Do not ship the default zinc/purple look.

| Token | Hex | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Ink Navy | `#102A43` | Primary |
| Paper Green | `#1F6B57` | Sparse secondary |
| Golden Ochre | `#E6A329` | 3% accents |
| Paper Cream | `#F8F6F1` | Page background |
| Pure Paper | `#FFFFFF` | Surfaces |
| Graphite | `#20262E` | Text |
| Slate | `#667085` | Secondary text |
| Soft Grey | `#E4E7EC` | Borders |

**70% cream/white + 20% navy/graphite + 7% green + 3% gold.**

- Fonts: Manrope (headings), Inter (body/UI).
- Editorial grids, paper surfaces, modest radius (4–8px), no gradients, no cartoon stationery.
- Product cards: name, spec line, unit price + unit, tier hint, stock, **both** CTAs.
- Header: Cart and Quote List are visually different with independent counts.
- Mobile bottom nav: Home · Shop · Search · Quote · Cart.
- Motion sparingly. Honour `prefers-reduced-motion`.
